    <string name="how_to">怎么操作</string>
    <string name="how_to_sub">每个动作两种做法：手 / 手柄</string>
    <string name="how_to_pick">拿刀、换大小</string>
    <string name="how_to_pick_hand">伸手捏住托盘上的刀；再捏一下它的空位换大小</string>
    <string name="how_to_pick_ctrl">射线指着刀按扳机，刀就装在手柄上；摇杆上下换大小，B / Y 放回</string>
    <string name="how_to_add">加泥</string>
    <string name="how_to_add_hand">捏住拇指和食指，在泥上拖：拖过的地方鼓起来</string>
    <string name="how_to_add_ctrl">刀尖碰到泥，按住扳机拖</string>
    <string name="how_to_carve">挖</string>
    <string name="how_to_carve_hand">捏住在泥上拖，挖出沟；短捏一下挖个坑</string>
    <string name="how_to_carve_ctrl">刀尖碰到泥，按住扳机拖；点一下扳机挖个坑</string>
    <string name="how_to_smooth">抹平（刮平）</string>
    <string name="how_to_smooth_hand">捏住贴着泥面横着抹，棱角削成平面</string>
    <string name="how_to_smooth_ctrl">刀贴着泥面按住扳机横着抹</string>
    <string name="how_to_pull">拉</string>
    <string name="how_to_pull_hand">捏住一点泥往外拉，拉多远长多远</string>
    <string name="how_to_pull_ctrl">刀尖碰到泥按住扳机，往外拉</string>
    <string name="how_to_turn">转泥</string>
    <string name="how_to_turn_hand">捏住转盘边绕着转，或点 [转 90°]</string>
    <string name="how_to_turn_ctrl">摇杆左右：推一下转 90°，按住慢慢转</string>
    <string name="how_to_bench">挪工作台</string>
    <string name="how_to_bench_hand">捏住木板外沿拖，松手停在原处</string>
    <string name="how_to_bench_ctrl">射线按住木板外沿拖；拖的时候摇杆左右转 15°</string>
    <string name="about_no_hands">手部追踪没开，近场捏不可用</string>
    <string name="hint_bench">挪工作台：松手就停在这里</string>
    <string name="hint_bench_sub">摇杆左右转动；靠近虚线框会吸进去</string>
